    "abilities": {
      "P": {
        "slot": "P",
        "id": "SamiraPassive",
        "name": "Daredevil Impulse",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Samira builds a combo by hitting attacks or abilities unique from the previous hit. Samira's attacks in melee range deal additional magic damage. Samira's attacks against enemies affected by <status>Immobilizing</status> effects will dash her to her attack range. If the enemy is <status>Knocked Up</status>, she also keeps them <status>Knocked Up</status> briefly.",
        "bodyHtml": "Samira builds a combo by dealing damage with Attacks or Abilities against enemy champions unique from the previous one. Each one increases her <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Style</span>, from \"E\" to \"S\" grade (6 total). Samira gains <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">(2.8% ~ 3.5%[[si:scalelevel]]) Move Speed</span> per grade.<br /><br />Samira's Attacks and Abilities in melee range deal an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">((2 ~ 19[[si:scalelevel]]) + ([[si:scalead]](3.5% ~ 10.5%[[si:scalelevel]]) Attack Damage)) magic damage</span>, increased up to <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">((4 ~ 38[[si:scalelevel]]) + ([[si:scalead]](7% ~ 21%[[si:scalelevel]]) Attack Damage))</span> based on the target's missing Health.<br /><br />Samira's Attacks against enemies affected by <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Immobilizing</span> effects will dash her to her Attack Range. If the enemy is <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocked Up</span>, she also keeps them <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocked Up</span> for at least 0.5 seconds.",
