      "Q": {
        "slot": "Q",
        "id": "SamiraQ",
        "name": "Flair",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Samira fires a shot or swings her sword, dealing damage. If cast during Wild Rush, strike all enemies in her path upon completion.",
        "bodyHtml": "Samira fires a shot, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(0/5/10/15/20 + ([[si:scalead]]110% Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> to the first enemy hit.<br /><br />If this Ability is cast towards an enemy in melee range, Samira will instead slash with her sword, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(0/5/10/15/20 + ([[si:scalead]]110% Attack Damage)) physical damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Either hit can critically strike for <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(0/5/10/15/20 + ([[si:scalead]]110% Attack Damage)) × (0.5 + [[si:scalecritmult]]50% Critical Strike Damage)</span> damage and applies Life Steal at 100% effectiveness. </span><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">If cast during <span>Wild Rush</span>, Samira will strike all enemies in her path upon completion. </span>",
