        "bodyHtml": "Samira can only use this Ability if her current <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Style</span> rating is S. Using this Ability consumes all <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Style</span> rating.<br /><br />Samira unleashes a torrent of shots from her weapons, wildly shooting all enemies surrounding her 10 times over 2 seconds, each shot dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(20/40/60 + ([[si:scalead]]30% Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> and applying Life Steal at 100% effectiveness. Each shot can also critically strike.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">This Ability deals 25% damage to minions.</span>",
